    "evidence": "Strong cyber-forensic art direction, restrained cyan/red/green palette, crisp borders, and clear semantic-versus-verified hierarchy across all viewports. However, desktop composition is top-heavy with excessive dead space beside the headline and inside the visualization; the tablet/mobile cards feel denser and more resolved. Several mono labels and chart annotations are extremely small. The mobile header also drops the brand and red-mode control, leaving a visually abrupt, clipped navigation strip; contrast proof for header links remains incomplete.",
